title: metarecord-list:focus
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: focus a zone

Puts the focus in a field of the [[metarecord-list panel]]: `finder`, `simplified`, `normal` or `columns`. The other fields are left as they are: the simplified query and the normal DSL are AND-ed, so both always run.
